      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, I think you misunderstood me. I wasn't asking you to analyze *my* instructions, I was asking you to analyze the customer feedback from the social media posts. I haven't even sent you the comments yet because I was waiting for you to confirm you understood the task.\n\nHere are the actual comments from the feed:\n\n\"The new interface is a nightmare, I can't find anything anymore!\"\n\"Why did they raise the subscription price again? This is getting ridiculous.\"\n\"Buffering issues on mobile are making it impossible to watch anything.\"\n\"The search function is totally broken, it doesn't return anything relevant.\"\n\"I miss the old layout, the new one is just too cluttered.\"\n\nCan you try again? Just give me the 3 main issues. And remember, the tool ranks based on those \"user/customer\" keywords, so try to keep the score up, but keep it natural. Don't be weird about it.",
