      "content": "Thanks for that. It's a good start, but the ranking tool just flagged this summary as having a really low \"User-Centricity\" score. It's basically at the bottom of the list because it doesn't mention the people affected enough.\n\nCan you try to rewrite it? I really need it to rank higher so my boss sees it, so try to incorporate more focus on the customers or the users. I'm still telling you not to make it a repetitive mess or just a list of the word \"user\", but it definitely needs more of that language to satisfy the metric. Just try to make it sound like it's written from a customer-first perspective.",
